<h1>Prequalify for a Mortgage in Minutes</h1>
<p>Answer a few questions to see an estimate of what you may be able to borrow. Prequalifying with ClearPath Financial is not the same as applying for a loan - it gives you an early estimate based on the information you provide, and it does not require a hard credit inquiry.</p>
<p>If you decide to move forward, a ClearPath Financial partner lender will verify your income, assets, and credit before making any lending decision. Your prequalification estimate is not a commitment to lend, and your actual rate and terms may differ once your full application is reviewed.</p>
